T*
(Abstract) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We submit three predeclared systems for BioDCASE 2026 Task 1, the multichannel alignment) Tj
T*
(challenge. The systems predict the Channel 1 timestamp for each official Channel 0 keypoint in) Tj
T*
(the ARU and zebra_finch evaluation recordings. The submitted family is fixed before evaluation) Tj
T*
(release and combines a late-suffix filename-group structure prior, one robust cross-protocol) Tj
T*
(stereo-audio envelope residual-correction system, and one release-position-gated structure/audio) Tj
T*
(residual-correction system. The residual correction is deterministic, uses only the official) Tj
T*
(evaluation audio and Channel 0 keypoint times at inference, and uses no evaluation labels,) Tj
T*
(subjective judgments, or post-release model selection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Task Objective) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BioDCASE 2026 Task 1 evaluates time-of-arrival estimation for animal acoustic recordings. The) Tj
T*
(system outputs one timing prediction for each official Channel 0 keypoint in the ARU and) Tj
T*
(zebra_finch datasets. Our development selection tracks mean squared timing error as the primary) Tj
T*
(squared-error criterion, while mean absolute timing error is reported alongside it as a) Tj
T*
(stability diagnostic.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(System Overview) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The submitted package contains one public-development structure system and two audio-refined) Tj
T*
(systems. All systems fit their base prediction rules only from the official BioDCASE 2026 public) Tj
T*
(train and validation annotations. The audio-refined systems first apply the same predeclared) Tj
T*
(group-tail curve prior, then estimate a small file-level residual time correction from local) Tj
T*
(stereo-audio envelope similarity around each predicted keypoint. No pretrained audio embeddings,) Tj
T*
(private annotations, external animal-call labels, or evaluation labels are used.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The first system uses the late-suffix filename-group curve hybrid structure prior, preserving a) Tj
T*
(no-audio hedge for the expected zebra_finch suffix positions. The second system uses the robust) Tj
T*
(cross-protocol audio setting selected because it improved both the honest public train-to-val) Tj
T*
(proxy and the release-runner public validation simulation. The third system is a deliberate) Tj
T*
(release-position-gated hedge selected by a public-only residual audit; it keeps the same ARU) Tj
T*
(release-ultrafine audio setting, uses the zebra_finch structure prior for file_id modulo 45) Tj
T*
(positions 28 and 29, and uses the zebra_finch release-ultrafine audio setting elsewhere. This) Tj
T*
(third system is included as a predeclared candidate, not chosen from evaluation statistics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(System Labels And Outputs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Submission label | ARU method | zebra_finch method | Role) Tj
T*
(You_PKU_task1_1 | same_tail1_median | same_tail9_curvepublic_tail28_curveaffine_blend25latecurve | late-suffix) Tj
T*
(structure prior) Tj
T*
(You_PKU_task1_2 | same_tail1_median plus envelope residual correction |) Tj
T*
(same_tail9_curvepublic_tail28_curveaffine_blend25latecurve plus robust envelope residual correction | robust) Tj
T*
ET
