() Tj
T*
(The public-development evidence supports using inference-time stereo-audio envelope residual) Tj
T*
(correction as the strongest manual route. The release-position-gated system improves both the) Tj
T*
(release-runner public validation simulation and the train-only proxy by using the structure) Tj
T*
(prior for zebra_finch group positions 28 and 29 and release-ultrafine audio refinement) Tj
T*
(elsewhere. A full prior-year evaluation-shaped no-label audio-path smoke test confirmed that) Tj
T*
(this candidate set can produce complete ARU and zebra_finch outputs without relying on) Tj
T*
(validation annotation files.) Tj
T*
